  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3939,
  "text_len": 20
 },
 {
  "id": "sce119:00F7E",
  "jp": "フェイン「“えんか”？　なんだそれは？」",
  "off": 3966,
  "len": 27,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3968,
  "text_len": 24
 },
 {
  "id": "sce119:00F9C",
  "jp": "ヤマト「う～ん、たとえるニャら“日本人の{nl}　心の唄”かニャ？」",
  "off": 3996,
  "len": 43,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 3998,
  "text_len": 40
 },
 {
  "id": "sce119:00FCA",
  "jp": "フェイン「心？　それはつまり魂に直接響くような歌{nl}　ということか？」",
  "off": 4042,
  "len": 45,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4044,
  "text_len": 42
 },
 {
  "id": "sce119:00FFA",
  "jp": "ヤマト「ま、まぁ、そんニャ感じ」",
  "off": 4090,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4092,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce119:01017",
  "jp": "フェイン「おおっ！　それはつまり俺の口上もそれだけ{nl}　素晴らしいってことだな！」",
  "off": 4119,
  "len": 50,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 4121,
  "text_len": 47
 },
